<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clist</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>clist
</pre>
<p>Lists all the clans of Valhalla, with the name of each clan's Master. 
Anyone can use it, in a clan or not; it is the place to start if you 
want to join one: find the Master, and write or tell them to ask to join 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cinfo</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>